            {
              "response": "# Repository Summary\n\n- Centralizes the VS Code configuration files normally found in `.vscode` under Git version control.  \n- Shared across all ATAP repositories via symbolic links, so updates propagate immediately to every linked project.  \n- Key files included:\n  - `extensions.json` – recommended editor extensions  \n  - `settings.json` – workspace settings  \n  - `tasks.json` – common build/test tasks  \n  - `launch.json` – debug/run configurations  \n  - `.prettierrc.yml` – Prettier formatting rules  \n  - `.eslintrc.json` – ESLint linting rules for JS/TS  \n  - `.copilot/` directory – (preview) GitHub Copilot instruction files  \n- Notes/TODOs:\n  - Automate change detection and administrator alerts on updates  \n  - Define a safe workflow for testing and approving modifications  ",
