          "toolCallRounds": [
            {
              "response": "Here’s one way to do this in your integrated terminal (PowerShell):\n\n````powershell\n# filepath: (run in c:\\Dropbox\\whertzing\\GitHub\\SharedVSCode)\n# 1. Grab all files in the repo\n$all = Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File | Select-Object -ExpandProperty FullName\n\n# 2. Define the files the README mentions\n$mentioned = @(\n  \"extensions.json\",\n  \"settings.json\",\n  \"tasks.json\",\n  \"launch.json\",\n  \".prettierrc.yml\",\n  \".eslintrc.json\"\n) + (Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File -Path .\\.copilot | Select-Object -ExpandProperty FullName)\n\n# 3. Show the ones not mentioned\n$all | Where-Object { $mentioned -notcontains $_ } | ForEach-Object { $_.Replace((Get-Location).Path + \"\\\",\"\") }\n````\n\nAfter running that you’ll get the list of files in this repo that aren’t referenced in ReadMe.md (for example, things like `.gitignore`, `LICENSE`, `ReadMe.md` itself, etc.).",
              "toolCalls": [],
              "toolInputRetry": 0,
              "id": "52a2ce4e-21d9-4ec4-9bf8-4683ae61291c"
            }
